# Skills

Procedures written down for this project and this machine. When one of these fits what you were asked, call the `Skill` tool with its name before you start and follow what comes back. A person reaches the same thing by typing `/<name>`.

- deploy — Ship the build
- review — Read a diff
- guide — The map of bingo itself: what it is, running it, sessions, the commands the kernel and the surface own, the settings layers and keys, and where files live. Read it before any question about bingo; it ends with one line per plugin page.
